      "cues": [
        {
          "id": 1,
          "start": 2.1,
          "end": 4.08,
          "en": "At this point in the course,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 2,
          "start": 4.08,
          "end": 8.31,
          "en": "you already learned a lot about some crucial core",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 3,
          "start": 8.31,
          "end": 10.83,
          "en": "React concepts, and of course,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 4,
          "start": 10.83,
          "end": 12.72,
          "en": "you're going to learn even more",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 5,
          "start": 12.72,
          "end": 14.73,
          "en": "throughout the rest of this course.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 6,
          "start": 14.73,
          "end": 16.89,
          "en": "But before you go there,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 7,
          "start": 16.89,
          "end": 21.89,
          "en": "before you dive deeper into React, I strongly recommend",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 8,
          "start": 21.99,
          "end": 24.51,
          "en": "that you first practice what you learned",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 9,
          "start": 24.51,
          "end": 28.86,
          "en": "and that's exactly what this core section will be there for.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 10,
          "start": 28.86,
          "end": 30.33,
          "en": "In this core section,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 11,
          "start": 30.33,
          "end": 33.66,
          "en": "we're going to build two demo projects,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 12,
          "start": 33.66,
          "end": 38.07,
          "en": "two basic yet non-trivial demo projects,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 13,
          "start": 38.07,
          "end": 41.04,
          "en": "which allow you to apply your knowledge",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 14,
          "start": 41.04,
          "end": 43.05,
          "en": "and to practice what you learned.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 15,
          "start": 43.05,
          "end": 46.08,
          "en": "Because in both projects you'll need to work",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 16,
          "start": 46.08,
          "end": 49.92,
          "en": "with components, state, some styling",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 17,
          "start": 49.92,
          "end": 53.61,
          "en": "and all these crucial core concepts we explored",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 18,
          "start": 53.61,
          "end": 55.98,
          "en": "throughout the previous sections.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 19,
          "start": 55.98,
          "end": 58.23,
          "en": "Therefore, in this section here,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 20,
          "start": 58.23,
          "end": 61.89,
          "en": "you'll practice how to split an existing component",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 21,
          "start": 61.89,
          "end": 65.25,
          "en": "and an existing application into multiple components,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 22,
          "start": 65.25,
          "end": 67.29,
          "en": "and you'll also practice how to build",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 23,
          "start": 67.29,
          "end": 69.87,
          "en": "an application from scratch.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 24,
          "start": 69.87,
          "end": 72.96000000000001,
          "en": "You will practice how to work with state,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 25,
          "start": 72.96000000000001,
          "end": 75.03,
          "en": "how to manage and use state,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 26,
          "start": 75.03,
          "end": 80.03,
          "en": "and you'll practice outputting list and conditional content.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 27,
          "start": 80.07,
          "end": 82.35,
          "en": "Now, for both practice projects",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 28,
          "start": 82.35,
          "end": 85.44,
          "en": "which I prepared for you for this section here,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 29,
          "start": 85.44,
          "end": 88.32,
          "en": "I will give you an introduction to those projects.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 30,
          "start": 88.32,
          "end": 90.69,
          "en": "I'll provide you with some starting code",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 31,
          "start": 90.69,
          "end": 92.49000000000001,
          "en": "and I'll give you some tasks",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 32,
          "start": 92.49000000000001,
          "end": 95.88,
          "en": "or show you how the finished project should look like,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 33,
          "start": 95.88,
          "end": 98.67,
          "en": "but I then absolutely would recommend",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 34,
          "start": 98.67,
          "end": 101.61,
          "en": "that you first try solving these tasks",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 35,
          "start": 101.61,
          "end": 104.19,
          "en": "and building those projects on your own",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 36,
          "start": 104.19,
          "end": 107.55,
          "en": "before you then take a look at my example solution,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 37,
          "start": 107.55,
          "end": 112.32,
          "en": "which I of course will also provide as part of this section.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 38,
          "start": 112.32,
          "end": 115.65,
          "en": "Because by trying these things on your own first,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 39,
          "start": 115.65,
          "end": 118.2,
          "en": "you'll of course learn more about React",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 40,
          "start": 118.2,
          "end": 122.22,
          "en": "and you'll be able to confirm that you really understood",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 41,
          "start": 122.22,
          "end": 125.43,
          "en": "all these core concepts up to this point.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 42,
          "start": 125.43,
          "end": 129.63,
          "en": "That being said, after every demo project introduction,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 43,
          "start": 129.63,
          "end": 133.44,
          "en": "I will provide you with detailed solution steps",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 44,
          "start": 133.44,
          "end": 136.5,
          "en": "allowing you to compare your solution to mine,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 45,
          "start": 136.5,
          "end": 139.2,
          "en": "and of course, whilst building that solution together",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 46,
          "start": 139.2,
          "end": 143.55,
          "en": "with you, I'll also explain why I chose a certain approach",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 47,
          "start": 143.55,
          "end": 147.84,
          "en": "and why I solved the tasks as I did solve them.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 48,
          "start": 147.84,
          "end": 150.57,
          "en": "So definitely take a look at my solution as well,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 49,
          "start": 150.57,
          "end": 154.293,
          "en": "but also definitely try those projects on your own first.",
          "zh": ""
        }
      ]
